1
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:04,089
[MUSIC PLAYS ON LAPTOPS]

2
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:15,560
All right, just a few more feet and...

3
00:00:15,724 --> 00:00:18,934
(Howard:)Here we are, gentlemen,
the Gates of Elzebub.

4
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:20,606
SHELDON: Good Lord.
RAJESH: Oh.

5
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:24,020
(Leonard:)Don't panic. This is what the last
97 hours have been about.

6
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,320
Stay frosty. There's a horde of goblins...

7
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:29,944
(Howard:)...on the other side of that gate
guarding the Sword of Azeroth.

8
00:00:30,113 --> 00:00:33,203
(Leonard:)Warriors, unsheathe your weapons.
Magic wielders, raise your wands.

9
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:34,446
(Sheldon:)Lock and load.

10
00:00:34,617 --> 00:00:36,787
Raj, blow the gates.

11
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:38,203
(Raj:)Blowing the gates.

12
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:42,912
Control-shift-B.

13
00:00:43,084 --> 00:00:44,914
[RUMBLING AND GOBLINS
SCREAMING ON LAPTOPS]

14
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:47,836
(Raj:)- Oh, my God, so many goblins.
HOWARD: Aah!

15
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:50,086
(Howard:)Don't just stand there. Slash and move.

16
00:00:50,258 --> 00:00:51,428
(Leonard:)Stay in formation.

17
00:00:51,593 --> 00:00:55,183
- Leonard, you got one on your tail.
- That's all right, my tail's prehensile.

18
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:56,516
I got him, Leonard.

19
00:00:56,681 --> 00:01:00,391
(Raj:)Tonight, I spice my meat
with goblin blood.

20
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,390
Raj, it's a trap. They're flanking us.

